{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## CG tests for $[3,1,0]^{\\otimes2}$, $[3,2,0]^{\\otimes2}$, $[4,2,0]^{\\otimes2}$: which highest-weight states do the functional families reach after untwisting?\n\nWrite-up: `xxx-310-cg-test.tex` / `.pdf`. Same procedure as `xxx-210-cg-test.wb`; rep switch `lamSwitchC` (cell 3), valid for $\\lambda_2\\le2$; $\\{2,1,0\\}$ reproduces the adjoint counts exactly. **Saved outputs are the last run, $[4,2,0]$.** $\\langle v_{\\rm tot}|=\\langle v_1|\\sum_{m=0}^{\\lambda_2}(-1)^m\\binom{\\lambda_2}{m}k_2^m\\,t_{\\{m,m\\}}(\\theta_1)$, $\\langle v_1|=(1-k_1z_1)^{\\lambda_1-\\lambda_2}e_1^Te^{p_1'E_{12}}e^{p_2E_{13}}e^{p_3E_{23}}$.\n- **Old family** (`L2-mathcalA`): $\\langle v_{\\rm tot}|\\otimes\\langle\\mathrm{vacL}|$ $\\to$ $v_{\\rm new}=v_{\\rm tot}g_0^{-1}$ (cells 3–5).\n- **Determinant family** (`L2-det-mathcalA`): $\\langle v_{\\rm tot}|\\otimes\\langle v_1|$ $\\to$ $v'_{\\rm new}\\propto v_{\\rm tot}g_1^{-1}$ (cells 6–7).\n- **$w$-vacuum family** (`L2-vacw-mathcalA`): $\\langle u\\,T|\\otimes\\langle u|$ $\\to$ $v''_{\\rm new}=e_1^Tg_uTg_u^{-1}$, $z$ and $w$ both untwisted (cells 9–10).\n\nCell 8: finite-twist rank of the overlap map on all hw vectors.\n\n**Results (exact).** hw states reached (old / det / $w$-vac / all):\n\n| rep | # hw | old | det | $w$-vac | all | missed | site-1 weights where $v_{\\rm new}\\equiv0$ |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| $[2,1,0]$ | 6 | 5 | 3 | 3 | 5 | $[2,2,2]$ | $\\mu_3=2$ |\n| $[3,1,0]$ | 10 | 8 | 3 | 3 | 8 | $[4,2,2],[3,3,2]$ | $\\mu_3\\ge2$ |\n| $[3,2,0]$ | 10 | 9 | 6 | 6 | 9 | $[4,3,3]$ | $\\mu_3=3$ |\n| $[4,2,0]$ | 19 | 15 | 6 | 6 | 15 | $[6,3,3],[5,4,3]^{\\times2},[4,4,4]$ | $\\mu_3\\ge3$ |\n\nIn all four: $v_{\\rm new}$ vanishes identically (finite twist) exactly at site-1 weights with $\\mu_3>\\lambda_2$, and the missed irreps are exactly those with $\\nu_3>\\lambda_2$ ($[4,2,0]$ was a prediction). The determinant and $w$-vacuum families never add a state. Finite-twist overlap rank on all hw vectors equals the \"all\" column in every rep.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ps[rep_] :=\n    ps[rep] =\n    Block[\n        {res = (Prepend[rep, #]& /@ (Tuples[Table[Range[rep〚1, i + 1〛, rep〚1, i〛], {i, 1, Length[rep〚1〛] - 1}]]))},\n        If[Length[res〚1, 1〛] == 1, Reverse @ Sort @ res, Reverse @ Sort @ Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]\n    ];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat〚k, i〛, {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat〚k - 1, i〛, {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] :=\n    Jp[k][pat] =\n    -Sum[\n        Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k + 1, j〛 + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]\n        / Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k, j〛 + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} → pat〚k, i〛 + 1]],\n        {i, 1, k}\n    ];\nJm[k_][pat_] :=\n    Jm[k][pat] =\n    Sum[\n        Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k - 1, j〛 + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]\n        / Product[pat〚k, i〛 - i - pat〚k, j〛 + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} → pat〚k, i〛 - 1]],\n        {i, 1, k}\n    ];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] :=\n    JJ[k, l, rep] =\n    Which[\n        k == l,\n        DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n        l == k + 1,\n        Transpose[Table[Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}]〚i〛], v[#]]& /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n        l == k - 1,\n        Transpose[Table[Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}]〚i〛], v[#]]& /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n        l > k + 1,\n        JJ[k, k + 1, rep].JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep].JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n        l < k - 1,\n        JJ[k, k - 1, rep].JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep].JJ[k, k - 1, rep]\n    ];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 1. Single site (site 1), L1-mathcalA conventions, everything exact with symbolic z[k], θ[1], h, p1, p2, k1, k2.\n   T_ij(u) = (u - θ1) δ_ij - h E_ji, t_a = sum_{|I|=a} z_I qminor_{I,I}; fused (L1-mathcalA normalization, ν1(u) = u - θ1 - λ1 h):\n   t11(u) = t2(u)/(ν1(u) ν1(u-h)),  t22(u) = (t2(u) t2(u+h) - t3(u+h) t1(u))/(ν1(u) ν1(u-h) ν1(u+h) ν1(u)).\n   Second factor (L2-mathcalA Result 4): v_tot = v1 . sum_{m=0..λ2} (-1)^m binom(λ2, m) k2^m t_mm(θ1).\n   v_new = v_tot . g0^-1 is the site-1 covector left after undoing the global rotation, site 2 becoming e1^T.\n   Switch: lamSwitchC (default {3,1,0}; {2,1,0} reproduces xxx-210-cg-test.wb). Valid for λ2 <= 2. ---- *)\nClearAll[lamC, dC, EC, LaxC, qminC, tGC, nu1C, p3C, g0C, p1pC, v1C, tmmC, tHatC, vtotC, vnewC];\nIf[! ListQ[lamSwitchC], lamSwitchC = {3, 1, 0}];\nlamC = lamSwitchC; dC = dim[lamC];\nEC[i_, j_] := EC[i, j] = JJ[i, j, lamC];\nLaxC[i_, j_][x_] := (x - θ[1]) KroneckerDelta[i, j] IdentityMatrix[dC] - h EC[j, i];\nqminC[II_][x_] := Sum[Signature[s] Dot @@ Table[LaxC[II[[s[[k]]]], II[[k]]][x - (k - 1) h], {k, Length[II]}], {s, Permutations[Range[Length[II]]]}];\ntGC[a_][x_] := Sum[(Times @@ (z /@ II)) qminC[II][x], {II, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\nnu1C[x_] := x - θ[1] - h lamC[[1]];\n\np3C = p2 (z[3] - z[1]) / (p1 (z[2] - z[3]));\ng0C = MatrixExp[p1 EC[1, 2]] . MatrixExp[p2 EC[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[p3C EC[2, 3]];\np1pC = p1 (1 - k1 z[2]) / (1 - k1 z[1]);\nv1C = (1 - k1 z[1])^(lamC[[1]] - lamC[[2]]) UnitVector[dC, 1] . MatrixExp[p1pC EC[1, 2]] . MatrixExp[p2 EC[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[p3C EC[2, 3]];\ntmmC[0] = IdentityMatrix[dC];\ntmmC[1] = With[{x = θ[1]}, Together[tGC[2][x] / (nu1C[x] nu1C[x - h])]];\ntmmC[2] = With[{x = θ[1]}, Together[(tGC[2][x] . tGC[2][x + h] - tGC[3][x + h] . tGC[1][x]) / (nu1C[x] nu1C[x - h] nu1C[x + h] nu1C[x])]];\ntHatC = tmmC[1];\nvtotC = v1C . Sum[(-1)^m Binomial[lamC[[2]], m] k2^m tmmC[m], {m, 0, lamC[[2]]}];\nvnewC = Together /@ (vtotC . Inverse[g0C]);\n\nGrid[\n    {\n        {\"site rep, dim\", {lamC, dC}},\n        {\"E_ij (i<j) raise: e1 is annihilated by E12, E13, E23\", And @@ (EC[#[[1]], #[[2]]] . UnitVector[dC, 1] === ConstantArray[0, dC] & /@ {{1, 2}, {1, 3}, {2, 3}})},\n        {\"v1 . g0^-1 = (1 - k1 z1)^d e1^T exp((p1' - p1) E12)\", Simplify[v1C . Inverse[g0C] - (1 - k1 z[1])^(lamC[[1]] - lamC[[2]]) UnitVector[dC, 1] . MatrixExp[(p1pC - p1) EC[1, 2]]] === ConstantArray[0, dC]},\n        {\"GT patterns (basis order)\", ps[{lamC}]}\n    },\n    Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
