span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-36.101em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:20.2505em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-37.301em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:20.2505em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-38.501em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:20.2505em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:17.7505em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
