      {
       "data": "Out[899]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{site rep, dim} & \\left\\{\\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\},27\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{E\\_ij (i<j) raise: e1 is annihilated by E12, E13, E23} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{v1 . g0\\^{}-1 = (1 - k1 z1)\\^{}d e1\\^{}T exp((p1' - p1) E12)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{GT patterns (basis order)} & \\begin{pmatrix}\\left\\{4\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{4\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{4\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{3\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{3\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{3\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{3\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{3\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{3\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{2\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{2\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{2\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,0\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{2\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,2\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{2\\right\\} & \\left\\{3,1\\right\\} & \\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\}\\\\\\left\\{2\\rig… [latex truncated: 2024 chars total]",
