ight:14.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-24.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:14.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-25.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:14.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-26.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:14.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-27.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:14.85em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:12.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[909]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{weight $\\mu$} & \\text{dim V\\_$\\mu$} & \\text{leading $\\varepsilon$ order of v\\_new in V\\_$\\mu$} & \\text{rank} & \\text{sample-rank check}\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\} & 1 & 0 & 1 & 1\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,1,1\\right\\} & 1 & 1 & 1 & 1\\\\\\hline\\left\\{4,0,2\\right\\} & 1 & 2 & 1 & 1\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,3,0\\right\\} & 1 & 1 & 1 & 1\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,2,1\\right\\} & 2 & 2 & 2 & 2\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,1,2\\right\\} & 2 & 3 & 2 & 2\\\\\\hline\\left\\{3,0,3\\right\\} & 1 & \\infty  & 0 & 0\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,4,0\\right\\} & 1 & 2 & 1 & 1\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,3,1\\right\\} & 2 & 3 & 2 & 2\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,2,2\\right\\} & 3 & 4 & 3 & 3\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,1,3\\right\\} & 2 & \\infty  & 0 & 0\\\\\\hline\\left\\{2,0,4\\right\\} & 1 & \\infty  & 0 & 0\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,4,1\\right\\} & 1 & 4 & 1 & 1\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,3,2\\right\\} & 2 & 5 & 2 & 2\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,2,3\\right\\} & 2 & \\infty  & 0 & 0\\\\\\hline\\left\\{1,1,4\\right\\} & 1 & \\infty  & 0 & 0\\\\\\hline\\left\\{0,4,2\\right\\} & 1 & 6 & 1 & 1\\\\\\hline\\left\\{0,3,3\\right\\} & 1 & \\infty  & 0 & 0\\\\\\hline\\left\\{0,2,4\\right\\} & 1 & \\infty  & 0 & 0\\\\\\hline\\text{series order too low somewhere?} & \\mathrm{False} &  &  & \\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "0d6e2515-68cd-4b65-b866-606d82897d36"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 3. V (x) V. The covectors are c (x) e1^T, so a hw vector of total weight nu pairs only with the site-1 component of weight nu - λ.\n   hw vectors of weight nu = common kernel of the total raising E12, E23 (E13 follows) in (V (x) V)_nu.\n   pairRankOf[mu, {families}] = rank of the union of the families' leading coefficient vectors in weight mu, paired with the hw vectors. ---- *)\nClearAll[idC, Etot2C, wt2C, hwC, hwWtsC, exactZeroC, leadOrZero, pairRankOf, rowsHWC];\nidC = IdentityMatrix[dC];\nEtot2C[i_, j_] := KroneckerProduct[EC[i, j], idC] + KroneckerProduct[idC, EC[i, j]];\nwt2C = Transpose[Table[Diagonal[Etot2C[i, i]], {i, 3}]];\nhwC[nu_] := hwC[nu] = With[{idx = Flatten @ Position[wt2C, nu]},\n    With[{ns = NullSpace[Join[Etot2C[1, 2][[All, idx]], Etot2C[2, 3][[All, idx]]]]}, Table[ReplacePart[ConstantArray[0, dC^2], Thread[idx -> w]], {w, ns}]]\n];\nhwWtsC = Select[Union[wt2C], hwC[#] =!= {} &];\nexactZeroC = Table[{wtC[[n]], Simplify[vnewC[[n]]] === 0}, {n, dC}];\nleadOrZero[lw_, mu_] := If[KeyExistsQ[lw, mu], lw[mu][[2]], ConstantArray[0, dC]];\npairRankOf[mu_, lvs_List] := With[{hw = hwC[mu + lamC]},\n    If[hw === {}, 0, MatrixRank[(Join @@ (coefMatC /@ lvs)) . Transpose[Table[Partition[w, dC][[All, 1]], {w, hw}]]]]\n];\nrowsHWC = Table[{nu, Length[hwC[nu]], pairRankOf[nu - lamC, {leadOrZero[leadWC, nu - lamC]}]}, {nu, hwWtsC}];\n\nColumn[{\n    Grid[Prepend[exactZeroC, {\"site-1 weight of basis vector\", \"v_new component identically 0\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left],\n    Grid[{{\"highest-weight states: total, reached by v_new (x) e1\", {Total[rowsHWC[[All, 2]]], Total[rowsHWC[[All, 3]]]}}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left],\n    Grid[Prepend[rowsHWC, {\"hw weight nu (irrep of V (x) V)\", \"# hw states\", \"rank reached\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]\n}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
