   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### The determinant covector of `L2-det-mathcalA.wb`: $\\langle v_{\\rm tot}|\\otimes\\langle v_1|$\n\nSite 2 carries $\\langle v_1|=(1-k_1z_1)^2e_1^Tg_1$, $g_1=e^{p_1'E_{12}}e^{p_2E_{13}}e^{p_3E_{23}}$. Undo globally: $\\langle v'_{\\rm new}|\\otimes e_1^T$ with $v'_{\\rm new}=(1-k_1z_1)^2v_{\\rm tot}g_1^{-1}=(1-k_1z_1)^4e_1^T(1-k_2g_1\\hat tg_1^{-1})$. $g_1\\in N_+$ fixes every hw vector, so the hw pairings are unchanged by this step. Untwist and count as in cells 4–5, alone and combined with $v_{\\rm new}$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 4. Determinant family: v'_new = (1 - k1 z1)^d v_tot . g1^-1, g1 = the site-2 rotation of v1 (depends on k1), d = λ1 - λ2.\n   Same untwisting / per-weight leading order / hw pairing; \"combined\" = union of v_new and v'_new in each weight space. ---- *)\nClearAll[g1C, vnew2C, leadW2C, hwFixedC, exactZero2C, trunc2C, rowsHW2C];\ng1C = MatrixExp[p1pC EC[1, 2]] . MatrixExp[p2 EC[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[p3C EC[2, 3]];\nvnew2C = Together /@ ((1 - k1 z[1])^(lamC[[1]] - lamC[[2]]) vtotC . Inverse[g1C]);\nhwFixedC = And @@ Flatten @ Table[Simplify[KroneckerProduct[g1C, g1C] . w - w] === ConstantArray[0, dC^2], {nu, hwWtsC}, {w, hwC[nu]}];\nexactZero2C = Table[{wtC[[n]], Simplify[vnew2C[[n]]] === 0}, {n, dC}];\nleadW2C = leadWOf[vnew2C]; trunc2C = truncTooLowC;\nrowsHW2C = Table[\n    With[{mu = nu - lamC},\n        {nu, Length[hwC[nu]], pairRankOf[mu, {leadOrZero[leadWC, mu]}], pairRankOf[mu, {leadOrZero[leadW2C, mu]}], pairRankOf[mu, {leadOrZero[leadWC, mu], leadOrZero[leadW2C, mu]}]}\n    ],\n    {nu, hwWtsC}\n];\nColumn[{\n    Grid[\n        {\n            {\"v1 . g1^-1 = (1 - k1 z1)^d e1^T\", Simplify[v1C . Inverse[g1C] - (1 - k1 z[1])^(lamC[[1]] - lamC[[2]]) UnitVector[dC, 1]] === ConstantArray[0, dC]},\n            {\"g1 (x) g1 fixes all hw vectors of V (x) V\", hwFixedC},\n            {\"series order too low somewhere (v'_new)?\", trunc2C}\n        },\n        Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n    ],\n    Grid[Prepend[Transpose[{exactZeroC[[All, 1]], exactZeroC[[All, 2]], exactZero2C[[All, 2]]}], {\"site-1 weight\", \"v_new component ≡ 0\", \"v'_new component ≡ 0\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left],\n    Grid[Prepend[Append[rowsHW2C, {\"total\", Total[rowsHW2C[[All, 2]]], Total[rowsHW2C[[All, 3]]], Total[rowsHW2C[[All, 4]]], Total[rowsHW2C[[All, 5]]]}],\n        {\"hw weight nu\", \"# hw states\", \"rank: old v_new\", \"rank: new v'_new\", \"rank: combined\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]\n}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"389651\" data-output-id=\"69\" data-out-n=\"928\" data-sub-idx=\"8\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"6\" data-sub-start=\"14\" data-sub-end=\"26\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[928]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"22\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:55.32em;vertical-align:-27.41em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:27.91em;\"><span style=\"top:-44.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:19.09em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">v1 . g1</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;