      {
       "data": "Out[929]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{site rep} & \\left\\{4,2,0\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{\\# hw vectors of V (x) V (all weights)} & 19\\\\\\hline\\text{rank of the overlap map, old family v\\_new} & 15\\\\\\hline\\text{rank, old + determinant family} & 15\\\\\\hline\\text{hw weights where the per-weight rank < multiplicity (missed)} & \\begin{pmatrix}4 & 4 & 4\\\\5 & 4 & 3\\\\6 & 3 & 3\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "d11c1a3a-b252-402e-b22f-574e73040602"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Third family: the 6×6 against the vacuum at twist $w$, times the second factor (`L2-vacw-mathcalA.wb`)\n\nThere: $S_B(w)\\,F_B=C\\,\\langle u\\otimes u|\\,T\\otimes1\\,|\\Psi_B\\rangle$, $T=\\sum_m(-1)^m\\binom{\\lambda_2}{m}k_2^m t_{\\{m,m\\}}(\\theta_1)$, $u=e_1^Tg_u$, $g_u=e^{aE_{12}}e^{bE_{13}}e^{cE_{23}}$ with (flag closed form)\n$$a=p_1\\frac{(z_2-w_2)(z_2-w_3)}{(z_1-w_2)(z_1-w_3)},\\quad b=p_2\\frac{z_3-w_3}{z_1-w_3},\\quad c=p_3\\frac{z_3-w_3}{z_2-w_3}.$$\nUndo $g_u$ globally ($g_u\\in N_+$ fixes all hw vectors): $\\langle v''_{\\rm new}|\\otimes e_1^T$, $v''_{\\rm new}=e_1^Tg_u\\,T\\,g_u^{-1}$. Untwist $z_k=e^{\\varphi_k\\varepsilon}$ **and** $w_k=e^{ww_k\\varepsilon}$, leading order per weight space, ranks in $(k_2,p_1,p_2,\\varphi_k,ww_k,\\theta_1,h)$.\n\n**Result (exact, all three reps; truncation flag false).** hw states reached — old / det / **new** / all three:\n\n| rep | # hw | old | det | new $v''$ | all three | missed | finite-twist rank (new, all three) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| $[2,1,0]$ | 6 | 5 | 3 | 3 | 5 | $[2,2,2]$ | 3, 5 |\n| $[3,1,0]$ | 10 | 8 | 3 | 3 | 8 | $[4,2,2],[3,3,2]$ | 3, 8 |\n| $[3,2,0]$ | 10 | 9 | 6 | 6 | 9 | $[4,3,3]$ | 6, 9 |\n\n$v''_{\\rm new}$ has exactly the exact-zero pattern of the determinant family $v'_{\\rm new}$ (adjoint: $(1,2,0),(0,2,1),(1,0,2),(0,1,2)$; $[3,1,0]$: nine weights; $[3,2,0]$: $(0,2,3),(0,3,2),(1,1,3),(1,3,1),(2,0,3),(2,3,0)$). Both are of the form $e_1^T\\,n\\,T\\,n^{-1}$ with $n\\in N_+$; the extra freedom in $w$ adds nothing. **No new highest-weight states.** Saved outputs: $[3,2,0]$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 6. Third family v''_new = e1^T g_u T g_u^-1 (the w-vacuum 6x6 x second factor, site-2 rotation undone). Symbols: twist w[k], exponent ww[k].\n   Same per-weight leading order / hw pairing as cells 4-5, with both z and w expanded; combined with v_new (cell 4) and v'_new (cell 7).\n   Also the finite-twist rank of the overlap map on all hw vectors (as cell 8). ---- *)\nClearAll[aU, bU, cU, guC, TC, vnew3C, leadWOfZW, leadW3C, trunc3C, exactZero3C, hwFixed3C, rowsHW3C, joint3C];\naU = p1 (z[2] - w[2]) (z[2] - w[3]) / ((z[1] - w[2]) (z[1] - w[3]));\nbU = p2 (z[3] - w[3]) / (z[1] - w[3]);\ncU = p3C (z[3] - w[3]) / (z[2] - w[3]);\nguC = MatrixExp[aU EC[1, 2]] . MatrixExp[bU EC[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[cU EC[2, 3]];\nTC = Sum[(-1)^m Binomial[lamC[[2]], m] k2^m tmmC[m], {m, 0, lamC[[2]]}];\nvnew3C = Together /@ (UnitVector[dC, 1] . guC . TC . Inverse[guC]);\nhwFixed3C = And @@ Flatten @ Table[Simplify[KroneckerProduct[guC, guC] . w0 - w0] === ConstantArray[0, dC^2], {nu, hwWtsC}, {w0, hwC[nu]}];\nexactZero3C = Table[{wtC[[n]], Simplify[vnew3C[[n]]] === 0}, {n, dC}];\n(* leadWOf with z and w both expanded *)\nleadWOfZW[vec_] := Module[{ser, ord},\n    ser = Table[Normal[Series[c /. {z[k_] :> Exp[φ[k] ε], w[k_] :> Exp[ww[k] ε]}, {ε, 0, nSerC}]], {c, vec}];\n    ord = Table[With[{cl = CoefficientList[Together[s], ε]}, With[{nz = Flatten @ Position[Simplify /@ cl, _?(# =!= 0 &), {1}, Heads -> False]}, If[nz === {}, Infinity, First[nz] - 1]]], {s, ser}];\n    truncTooLowC = Or @@ Table[ord[[n]] === Infinity && Simplify[vec[[n]]] =!= 0, {n, Length[vec]}];\n    Association @ Table[\n        With[{nW = Min[ord[[sec]]]},\n            wtC[[First[sec]]] -> {nW, Table[If[MemberQ[sec, n] && nW < Infinity, Simplify[Coefficient[ser[[n]], ε, nW]], 0], {n, dC}]}\n        ],\n        {sec, sectorsC}\n    ]\n];\nleadW3C = leadWOfZW[vnew3C]; trunc3C = truncTooLowC;\nrowsHW3C = Table[\n    With[{mu = nu - lamC},\n        {nu, Length[hwC[nu]], pairRankOf[mu, {leadOrZero[leadWC, mu]}], pairRankOf[mu, {leadOrZero[leadW2C, mu]}], pairRankOf[mu, {leadOrZero[leadW3C, mu]}],\n         pairRankOf[mu, {leadOrZero[leadWC, mu], leadOrZero[leadW2C, mu], leadOrZero[leadW3C, mu]}]}\n    ],\n    {nu, hwWtsC}\n];\njoint3C = Module[{hwAll = Flatten[Table[hwC[nu], {nu, hwWtsC}], 1], slices},\n    slices = Transpose[Table[Partition[w0, dC][[All, 1]], {w0, hwAll}]];\n    {Length[hwAll], MatrixRank[coefMatC[Together /@ (vnew3C . slices)]],\n     MatrixRank[Join[coefMatC[Together /@ (vnewC . slices)], coefMatC[Together /@ (vnew2C . slices)], coefMatC[Together /@ (vnew3C . slices)]]]}\n];\nColumn[{\n    Grid[\n        {\n            {\"site rep\", lamC},\n            {\"g_u (x) g_u fixes all hw vectors\", hwFixed3C},\n            {\"series order too low somewhere (v''_new)?\", trunc3C},\n            {\"finite twist: # hw vectors, rank (v''_new), rank (all three families)\", joint3C}\n        },\n        Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left\n    ],\n    Grid[Prepend[Transpose[{exactZeroC[[All, 1]], exactZeroC[[All, 2]], exactZero3C[[All, 2]]}], {\"site-1 weight\", \"v_new ≡ 0\", \"v''_new ≡ 0\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left],\n    Grid[Prepend[KeyValueMap[{#1, If[#2[[1]] === Infinity, \"-\", Superscript[\"ε\", #2[[1]]]], If[#2[[1]] === Infinity, 0, rankC[#2[[2]]]]} &, leadW3C], {\"weight of V\", \"leading order of v''_new\", \"rank\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left],\n    Grid[Prepend[Append[rowsHW3C, Prepend[Total /@ Transpose[rowsHW3C[[All, 2 ;; 6]]], \"total\"]],\n        {\"hw weight nu\", \"# hw\", \"old v_new\", \"det v'_new\", \"new v''_new\", \"all three\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]\n}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"389651\" data-output-id=\"71\" data-out-n=\"943\" data-sub-idx=\"15\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"9\" data-sub-start=\"37\" data-sub-end=\"51\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[943]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"22\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:80.56em;vertical-align:-40.03em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:40.53em;\"><span style=\"top:-56.93em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:19.09em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">site rep</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">g_u (x) g_u fixes all hw vectors</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">series order too low somewhere (v”_new)?</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">finite twist: # hw vectors, rank (v”_new), rank (all three families)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">False</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em